g a family[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]member, resolve stale transfer pids by adopting only dead holders' claim[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rows (never transferring away from a live process), and make no-op [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]releases record truthfully.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Surface permanently blocked waiters instead of only logging[/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]terminal-block-notify[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]terminal-block-notify: have the wait_checks chop upsert one deduplicated[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]inbox notification per terminally-blocked waiter naming the blocker and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]actionable guidance.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-10j","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-10j.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-e3e97612dc7e930660d7e8daa7cfaff7","started_at":"2026-09-14T01:57:08.957164+00:00","state":"active"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.kellys_mbp.sase-10j","bbugyi200.kellys_mbp.sase-10j.1","bbugyi200.kellys_mbp.sase-10j.2","bbugyi200.kellys_mbp.sase-10j.land"]}
